        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sharm El Sheikh, a bustling resort city, offers a mosaic of cultural experiences, blending local Egyptian charm with international influences. A stroll through the city’s diverse districts reveals a world of varied atmospheres and experiences."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "1. Soho: Little Britain in Sharm El Sheikh"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "British Ambiance:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Often referred to as “Little Britain,” the Soho area mirrors a classic British town, complete with European restaurants and iconic British phone booths."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "European Flair:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Known for its European essence, Soho is perfect for evening strolls, offering a glimpse into a neatly maintained, upscale version of a British town."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Elite and Upscale:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " This district is known for its high-end shops and dining establishments, reflecting European-style premium pricing."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "2. Il Mercato: Little Italy of Sharm El Sheikh"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Italian Influence:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Il Mercato, or “Little Italy,” is a vibrant street filled with shops and entertainment venues, echoing the charm of Italian streets."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Shopping and Entertainment:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " This area is a hub for those seeking a blend of retail therapy and leisure, offering a variety of shops and attractions."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "3. The Old Town: Heart of Egyptian Culture"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Authentic Egyptian Experience:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " The Old Town remains the most popular area for experiencing authentic Egyptian culture."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Shoppers’ Paradise:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Favored by those looking to explore local markets and shops, the Old Town is a treasure trove of traditional Egyptian goods and crafts."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Each of these districts in Sharm El Sheikh offers a unique cultural experience. Soho and Il Mercato provide a taste of Europe in the heart of Egypt, while the Old Town immerses visitors in the traditional Egyptian way of life. Together, they make Sharm El Sheikh a destination where every walk through the city can feel like a journey across different countries, catering to the tastes and preferences of a diverse array of travelers."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
